          "text": "Arista describes a client-to-cloud networking-as-a-service platform spanning AI, data center, campus and WAN domains, anchored by EOS and NetDL. Product revenue primarily comes from switching and routing products and related network applications; service revenue primarily comes from post-contract support (PCS) and renewals.",
